(b) You clearly disclose that the Software is provided without charge under this
    license and provide the customer with a copy of this license;
(c) the customer can obtain and use the supplied Software or Modified Version
    without buying Your services, and continued use does not require payment;
    and
(d) the arrangement is not a paid hosted/managed service or a hardware/product
    bundle prohibited by section 4.

Calling a Software sale "installation" or "maintenance" does not qualify for
this exception. No exception authorizes removing or concealing license notices.

